allow deviations like this.  Personally, I believe that the vast
majority of computer abuse/misuse problems (or perceived problems)
can be rectified in this very manner; sit down and have a chat, 
without the threat of automatic punitive action.  Hey, it works
for me; I've never had to file charges against a user, and I've
only had to use the threat of charges once or twice.

