	Horsefeathers.  Many users (on the systems that I use, and I'm
sure on many others) deliberately open files or subdirectories in
their accounts for other users to read.  Be they information files,
useful executables, or just "cool stuff that everyone should read",
they're all over, and it's accepted etiquitte to browse through open
directories, even personal ones, looking for interesting things.
