Okay, so what's your point?  In case one, singling out a speeding driver who
has a bumper sticker with "COPS SUCK" on it -- someone who has an obvious
disrespect for authority -- would be an attempt to instill some respect, or
at least demonstrate to the person that he is not immune to authority.
